  "step_3": "The decision reason requires comparing the maximum outcomes first (4000 vs. 3000), which favors A, and only if those are equal, comparing the minimum outcomes. The individual did not mention comparing maximum or minimum outcomes. Instead, the focus was on the probability of receiving any money (i.e., avoiding zero), not on the magnitude of the outcomes. The individual’s justification is about the value of a positive outcome (any money) rather than the preference for a higher maximum or more favorable minimum. Therefore, the individual did not apply the decision reason as specified. The reason was not used in the deliberation process.",
